  "title": "Kforce Brand Refresh Established Firm as a Workplace of the Future",
  "summary": "Kforce unveiled its new logo and core values Monday as part of a brand refresh that reflects the staffing and solutions firm’s ongoing evolution. The new brand elements, including a redesigned website, show a commitment to the factors distinguishing Kforce as a workplace of the future: technology, flexibility, adaptability and choice. Learn More",
